{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよ٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/10/24/6232055/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽっぺたぴっぱる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は9月お誕生日のことと\nのぎ天のこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、9月お誕生日の方！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、10月も終わっちゃうよ。という\n感じですよね。。、すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、お誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/10/24/6232055/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/10/24/6232055/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年になりますように٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月お誕生日の方！\n至急、お名前コメントしてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみません。。。よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/10/24/6232055/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからこの写真！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールでも問題出したのですが、\n私が指差してる足は\n誰の足でしょーうっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天で、高円寺にロケいきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/10/24/6232055/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食レポって本当に難しい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、プリンは本当にすぐなくなっちゃったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ美味しいし散策も楽しかったし、またロケいきたいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴー☆ジャスさんの、\nマダガスカルを勝手に使ってしまったの本当にすみませんでした。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、マダガスカルッッッって\n地球儀をみるとやりたくなります(｡>ω<｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして釣りサークル！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生初めての釣りは、海に出るということで前の日からドキドキで、あまり寝られませんでした。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、船酔いすることなく\n男前な船長とあやちゃんのおかげで\nタイとベラちゃん釣れました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/10/24/6232055/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベラちゃん2秒つまんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛かったけど、海にはなした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/10/24/6232055/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイ！タイ！めでたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の憧れでだいすきな\n前田敦子さんも、初めての釣りが\n船長の船だったみたいで、嬉しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"釣りサークル第二回はまだ収録してないのです